  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Spines, flame jets, and holy blasts are just some of the ways your eidolon might strike from a distance. Your eidolon gains a ranged unarmed attack with a range increment of 60 feet that deals 1d6 damage and has the magical and propulsive traits.</p><p>When you select this feat, choose a damage type for the attack: acid, bludgeoning, cold, electricity, fire, piercing, slashing, spirit, vitality, or void.</p>"
